t;string()\n \n                |strtrans()|も参照。\n```","ts":"1631703148.009600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"71304bad-5669-4ac8-9caf-ec882d257a7d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h string()","ts":"1631703146.009500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5uhO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13a540e9-4eb2-4e2c-9336-e7bc445bbe51","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"大昔にやっていたような気もする","ts":"1631703124.009300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ms+cT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bafd1481-09a5-487e-96d8-30c4b9aa3abb","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"jsonにすればロードできるのは知ってるんですけどそれだとパースに時間がかかるから何とかならないかなと","ts":"1631703109.008900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vUhfB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1e60b07-4bd6-43c8-b111-d566a66a8a24","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"変数の中身をVim scriptとして保存したいのですが、どうするのがよいですかね？","ts":"1631703084.008000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LNH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E746CBD6-94AD-4EE9-ADAE-3C28EEB4E5E5","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"JS、rubyの補完、かなりツライイメージがある","ts":"1631700684.007300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8mkJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2a4ed2a-a049-4848-a697-445d0d9b15ad","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"また、Typescript LSPが死んだ…","ts":"1631656411.005500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dQT"}]}]
